!Sample_data_processing = Paired-end alignment using STAR v2.4.0f1 and default parameters
!Sample_data_processing = Conversion of sam to bam file and ordering of aligned reads using SAMtools v0.1.18
!Sample_data_processing = Counting of reads aligning to transcripts using the summarizeOverlaps function of the R package GenomicAlignments v1.2.2 and GenomicRanges v1.18.4
!Sample_data_processing = Library-size normalized read counts were calculated using DESeq2 v1.6.3
